Bahut purane granth kehte hain, yahan kabhi badi nadi behti thi.

14
00:00:40,338 --> 00:00:44,536
Uska naam tha Saraswati. Rigveda use pavitra aur shaktishaali kehta hai.

15
00:00:44,536 --> 00:00:48,734
