24
00:01:14,013 --> 00:01:17,758
Rigveda duniya ke sabse purane granthon mein gina jata hai.

25
00:01:17,758 --> 00:01:20,753
Isme nadiyon ki tareef mein kai mantra hain.

26
00:01:20,753 --> 00:01:22,626
Aur isme ek sukta hai,

27
00:01:22,626 --> 00:01:26,370
