28
00:01:26,370 --> 00:01:30,644
Is sukta ka naam hai Nadistuti sukta, yaani nadiyon ki stuti,

29
00:01:30,644 --> 00:01:32,198
unki tareef ka geet.

30
00:01:32,198 --> 00:01:36,084
Isme nadiyan poorab se paschim ki taraf ginayi gayi hain.

31
00:01:36,084 --> 00:01:39,192
Pehle Ganga, phir Yamuna, phir Saraswati, phir Shutudri,

32
00:01:39,192 --> 00:01:42,300
jise aaj hum Sutlej kehte hain. Matlab Saraswati,

33
00:01:42,300 --> 00:01:45,020
Yamuna aur Sutlej ke beech kahin thi.

34
00:01:45,020 --> 00:01:48,758
Yeh chhoti baat nahi hai. Granth sirf naam nahi le raha,

35
00:01:48,758 --> 00:01:52,156
jagah bhi bata raha hai. Aaj ke naqshe par dekho,

36
