Raaste mein woh jeevon ko apne doodh jaise paani se paalti hai.

44
00:02:17,906 --> 00:02:22,000
Yaani yeh koi barsaati naala nahi, poori behti nadi thi.

45
00:02:22,000 --> 00:02:24,444
Ab aate hain Mahabharata par,

46
