47
00:02:27,865 --> 00:02:32,752
Iske Shalya Parva mein Saraswati ki kahani badal jaati hai.

48
00:02:32,752 --> 00:02:36,662
Yahan nadi registaan mein pahunchkar sookh jaati hai.

49
00:02:36,662 --> 00:02:42,038
Zameen ke andar samaa jaati hai. Jis jagah woh gayab hui,

50
00:02:42,038 --> 00:02:44,970
