51
00:02:44,970 --> 00:02:48,507
Vinasana ka matlab hi hai, jahan kuch nasht ho jaye,

52
00:02:48,507 --> 00:02:49,568
gayab ho jaye.

53
00:02:49,568 --> 00:02:53,458
Granth mein iski wajah bhi kahani ki tarah di gayi hai.

54
00:02:53,458 --> 00:02:57,349
Toh socho, Rigveda mein Saraswati pahad se samundar tak behti hai.

55
00:02:57,349 --> 00:03:00,885
Mahabharata tak aate aate, woh registaan mein kho jaati hai.

56
00:03:00,885 --> 00:03:02,300
Beech mein kya hua?

57
00:03:02,300 --> 00:03:05,842
Granth ne sawaal diya, ab vigyan ki baari.

58
00:03:05,842 --> 00:03:08,499
Agar sach mein yahan nadi thi,

59
00:03:08,499 --> 00:03:13,369
toh uske nishaan zameen mein bache honge. Nadi jab sookhti hai,

60
00:03:13,369 --> 00:03:16,911
toh apna raasta chhod jaati hai. Ret, kankad,

61
00:03:16,911 --> 00:03:18,682
aur neeche dabi nami.

62
00:03:18,682 --> 00:03:23,110
Inhe dhoondhne ke liye vaigyanikon ne aasmaan ki madad li.

63
00:03:23,110 --> 00:03:26,677
Is tareeke ko remote sensing kehte hain, yaani door se,

64
