69
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:44,252
ISRO ke Regional Remote Sensing Service Centre ke vaigyanikon ne yahi kiya.

70
00:03:44,252 --> 00:03:48,985
Unhone Indian Remote Sensing satellite ke Wide Field Sensor ka data liya.

71
00:03:48,985 --> 00:03:50,562
Aur uttar-paschim Bharat mein,

72
00:03:50,562 --> 00:03:53,717
