75
00:03:58,450 --> 00:04:01,316
Is sensor ki resolution thi 188 metre.

76
00:04:01,316 --> 00:04:04,181
Resolution yaani tasveer ka sabse chhota hissa,

77
00:04:04,181 --> 00:04:06,228
