78
00:04:06,228 --> 00:04:09,912
Matlab 188 metre se chhoti cheez alag nahi dikhti.

79
00:04:09,912 --> 00:04:14,416
Lekin nadi ke lambe raaste dekhne ke liye, yeh kaafi tha.

80
