108
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:51,925
Aur kinare par purani bastiyan milti hain. Lagta hai kahani khatam.

109
00:05:51,925 --> 00:05:55,070
Par asli behas yahin se shuru hoti hai.

110
00:05:55,070 --> 00:05:59,212
Vigyan mein akela sabut kaafi nahi hota. Yahan purani nadi thi,

111
00:05:59,212 --> 00:06:01,095
