117
00:06:18,558 --> 00:06:21,193
Glacier yaani pahadon par jami barf ki nadi,

118
00:06:21,193 --> 00:06:23,829
jo dheere dheere pighalti hai. Doosre kehte hain,

119
00:06:23,829 --> 00:06:26,135
Bronze Age yaani Kaanse ke yug mein,

120
00:06:26,135 --> 00:06:28,770
