Iska theek samay abhi pakka nahi.

168
00:09:08,170 --> 00:09:11,176
Phir sawaal nadiyon ke mudne ka.

169
00:09:11,176 --> 00:09:15,185
Sutlej ke hatne par research aa chuki hai.

170
00:09:15,185 --> 00:09:19,193
Lekin Yamuna ka raasta kab aur kaise badla,

171
00:09:19,193 --> 00:09:22,700
