Aridification yaani kisi ilaake ka dheere dheere sookha aur registaan jaisa ho jaana.

176
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:43,850
Monsoon kamzor hua, toh baarish wali nadiyan patli padti gayi.

177
00:09:43,850 --> 00:09:47,861
Kya yahi is nadi ke sookhne ki asli wajah thi?

178
00:09:47,861 --> 00:09:51,470
Ya tectonics aur mausam, dono ne milkar yeh kiya?

179
00:09:51,470 --> 00:09:52,993
