Achhi khabar yeh hai ki iske nishaan aaj bhi zameen par hain.

182
00:10:01,751 --> 00:10:04,797
Bas aankh thodi dhyaan se kholni padegi. Chaliye,

183
00:10:04,797 --> 00:10:06,320
